The '''Wood Chipper''' is used to convert [[Hardwood]] and [[Driftwood]] into other products. It can be purchased from the [[Carpenter's Shop]] for {{Price|1000}} starting the first day of [[Winter]] in year 1. The player receives a letter about the wood chipper from [[Robin]] on the second day of Winter in year 1. A Wood Chipper may be purchased from [[Kent]]'s [[Desert Festival#Villager Shops|shop]] at the [[Desert Festival]] for {{Price|25|Calico}} [[Calico Egg]]s.

